&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET Web API, Full Stack development, Equipment management, React.js, MongoDB, C#&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id="e011-p005-en"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


E011 - P005 - Mobile Inspection App
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Grupo de Empresas Tecnológicas · sept. 2020 - mar. 2022&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id="e011-p005-t005-en"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;E011 - P005 - T005 · Field Data Capture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;nov. 2021 - mar. 2022 · 5 months&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Associated with Grupo de Empresas Tecnológicas&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
I took part in the design and development of field data capture features for a technical inspection mobile application used by operational staff while carrying out work on installations, equipment and assets managed by the organization. The project was aimed at replacing manual paper-based procedures with digital processes integrated with corporate systems.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Make it easier to collect information directly from mobile devices, improve the quality of the data obtained during inspections and reduce the time needed to record, process and query the information generated in the field.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Development of information capture forms, recording of technical observations, validation of user-entered data, inspection status management, temporary information storage, synchronization with corporate systems and support for different types of inspections and operational procedures.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional requirements analysis, user experience design for mobile environments, development of data capture features, integration with corporate APIs, application performance optimization, functional validation and resolution of issues detected during testing and deployment.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Unity, C#, REST APIs, MongoDB, JSON, Git and technologies focused on enterprise mobile applications for the digitization of technical inspection processes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution improved the efficiency of field work, reduced errors from manual data entry, increased the immediate availability of data collected during inspections and made it easier to integrate that data with the organization's corporate systems.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Process automation, Mobile development, ASP.NET Web API, Database design, Full Stack development, Data modeling, C#, Unity, MongoDB&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id="e011-p005-t004-en"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;E011 - P005 - T004 · Offline/Online Synchronization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;jul. 2021 - oct. 2021 · 4 months&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Associated with Grupo de Empresas Tecnológicas&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
I took part in the design and implementation of an offline/online synchronization system for a technical inspection mobile application used by field staff. The project was aimed at ensuring the application worked in environments with limited or no connectivity, allowing users to continue working normally regardless of network availability.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Ensure the operational continuity of field inspection processes, allowing information to be captured, queried and modified offline and changes to be automatically synchronized with corporate systems whenever connectivity was available.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Development of local storage mechanisms, synchronization queue management, data conflict control, automatic and manual synchronization, information integrity validation, recovery from communication errors and tracking of the synchronization status of each operation performed by users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Technical and functional requirements analysis, design of the synchronization architecture, development of information exchange processes, implementation of local persistence mechanisms, integration with corporate APIs, validation of offline scenarios and performance optimization of the synchronization processes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Unity, C#, REST APIs, MongoDB, JSON, Git and technologies focused on enterprise mobile applications with offline capability and distributed data synchronization.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution allowed technicians to carry out inspections in locations with limited or no coverage, eliminating dependence on permanent connectivity, improving the reliability of information capture and ensuring secure data synchronization with corporate systems once the connection was restored.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; JSON, Mobile development, ASP.NET Web API, Software architecture, Full Stack development, Data modeling, C#, Unity, MongoDB&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id="e011-p005-t003-en"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;E011 - P005 - T003 · Photographic Evidence Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;mar. 2021 - jun. 2021 · 4 months&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Associated with Grupo de Empresas Tecnológicas&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
I took part in the design and development of a photographic evidence management system integrated into a technical inspection mobile application. The project was aimed at facilitating the capture, storage, querying and traceability of images obtained during inspections carried out by field technicians.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Digitize the process of collecting visual evidence associated with inspections, maintenance and incidents, ensuring the correct linking of images with operational records and improving the quality of the information available for subsequent analysis and audits.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Development of features for capturing photographs from mobile devices, associating images with specific inspections and assets, structured evidence storage, photo gallery visualization, image downloads, metadata management and historical querying of visual records associated with each field intervention.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional requirements analysis, design of evidence capture and query flows, development of mobile components, integration with backend services, implementation of image storage and retrieval mechanisms, optimization of file transfer processes and functional validation with end users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Unity, C#, REST APIs, MongoDB, JSON, Git and technologies focused on enterprise mobile applications with multimedia content and visual documentation management.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution significantly improved the traceability of inspections, made it easier to visually document incidents and technical actions, reduced the use of manual means for evidence management and increased the quality of the information available for tracking, review and audit processes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Process automation, Mobile development, ASP.NET Web API, Full Stack development, Document management, Technical documentation, C#, Unity, MongoDB&lt;/p&gt;

