Development of configuration-based dynamic forms, automatic generation of input controls, validation of required fields, management of different data types, section grouping, conditional visibility rules, structured information capture and storage of results for subsequent synchronization with corporate systems.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional requirements analysis, design of the form configuration model, development of reusable components, implementation of validation mechanisms, optimization of the user experience on mobile devices, integration with corporate APIs and functional validation with end users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Unity, C#, REST APIs, MongoDB, JSON, Git and technologies focused on enterprise mobile applications for the digitization of inspection processes and structured information capture.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution significantly reduced the time needed to adapt inspection processes to new requirements, improved the quality and consistency of the data captured in the field, reduced dependence on specific developments and provided a more flexible platform for the future evolution of the mobile application.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Process automation, Mobile development, ASP.NET Web API, Full Stack development, Data modeling, C#, User Experience (UX), Unity, MongoDB&lt;/p&gt;

