Design of the application's initial architecture, implementation of the main navigation, development of authentication and user management systems, configuration of communication with corporate services, creation of basic data structures, management of local configurations and preparation of the infrastructure needed for future functional extensions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional and technical requirements analysis, definition of the application's architecture, development of base components, integration with corporate APIs, design of the initial user experience, configuration of deployment processes and validation of the platform across different usage scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Unity, C#, REST APIs, MongoDB, JSON, Git and technologies focused on enterprise mobile applications for the digitization of technical and operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution provided a stable technological foundation for the subsequent evolution of the mobile application, making it easier to add new features, improving the productivity of field teams and enabling progress toward the full digitization of inspection and technical information collection processes.&lt;/p&gt;

