Redesign of management screens, improvement of complex forms, optimization of document validation processes, simplification of workflows, reorganization of the information shown to users, improvement of search and filtering mechanisms and optimization of the processes associated with case file tracking.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional analysis of existing processes, identification of user experience improvement points, interface redesign, implementation of frontend and backend improvements, query optimization, functional validation with end users and support during the rollout of the improvements.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
ASP.NET MVC, C#, SQL, Blazor, Razor, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, Git and technologies focused on enterprise web applications for administrative process management.&lt;/p&gt;

