I took part in the design and development of an automatic PDF certificate generation system for a drone pilot certification platform. The project was aimed at automating the issuance of official documentation associated with candidate evaluation, validation and certification processes, reducing manual tasks and improving the operational efficiency of administrative teams.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Automate the creation of certificates and official documentation generated by the platform, ensuring the consistency of the issued documents, reducing manual errors and streamlining the management processes associated with pilot certification.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Development of automatic PDF document generation processes, creation of dynamic templates, automatic incorporation of data from the system, generation of personalized certificates, numbering control and document traceability, storage of generated documents and centralized access to the issued documentation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional requirements analysis, design of document templates, development of backend services for document generation, integration with case file management modules, optimization of bulk generation processes and functional validation of the documentation produced by the platform.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
ASP.NET MVC, C#, SQL, Blazor, Razor, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, PDF generation libraries, Git and technologies focused on enterprise web applications for document automation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution fully automated the generation of official certificates, significantly reduced the time spent on administrative tasks, improved the quality and consistency of the issued documentation and increased the platform's operational capacity to handle certification processes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; JavaScript, Process automation, Blazor, ASP.NET MVC, SQL, Web development, Backend web development, ASP.NET Razor, Full Stack development, Document management, C#&lt;/p&gt;

