Development of features for uploading and storing documents, classification by document category, association of files with candidate case files, validation status control, document incident management, advanced information search and centralized access to the documentation required during the certification process.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Functional requirements analysis, design of the document structure, development of backend and frontend components, implementation of document validation processes, integration with case file management modules, query optimization and functional validation with administrative users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
ASP.NET MVC, C#, SQL, Blazor, Razor, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Git and technologies focused on enterprise web applications for document management and administrative processing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution improved the organization of the documentation associated with certification processes, reduced document search and validation times, increased case file traceability and provided a more efficient platform for managing candidates and certified pilots.&lt;/p&gt;

