ASP.NET MVC, C#, SQL, Blazor, Razor, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Git and technologies focused on enterprise web applications for administrative management and case file processing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The solution centralized candidate and certified pilot information, improved the quality and consistency of the recorded data, reduced manual administrative tasks and provided a solid foundation for the subsequent evolution of the drone pilot certification platform.&lt;/p&gt;

